1
00:00:00,884 --> 00:00:02,214
[SNORTS]

2
00:00:04,054 --> 00:00:07,054
(Leonard:)Sheldon, don't make that noise.
It's disrespectful.

3
00:00:07,224 --> 00:00:09,894
I should hope so.
It was a snort of derision.

4
00:00:10,811 --> 00:00:11,981
You agree with me, right?

5
00:00:12,146 --> 00:00:14,726
(Sheldon:)Loop quantum gravity
is the future of physics.

6
00:00:15,274 --> 00:00:19,614
(Leonard:)Sorry, Leslie, I guess I prefer
my space stringy, not loopy.

7
00:00:19,778 --> 00:00:23,488
(Leslie:)Well, I'm glad I found out the truth
about you before this went any further.

8
00:00:23,907 --> 00:00:25,117
Truth? What truth?

9
00:00:25,284 --> 00:00:28,534
(Leonard:)We're talking about untested hypotheses...
Look, it's no big deal.

10
00:00:28,745 --> 00:00:29,745
Oh, it isn't? Really?

11
00:00:29,913 --> 00:00:32,583
(Leslie:)Tell me, Leonard,
how will we raise the children?

12
00:00:35,544 --> 00:00:39,924
I guess we wait until they're old enough
and let them choose their own theory.

13
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:43,130
(Leslie:)We can't let them choose, Leonard,
they're children.

14
00:00:44,428 --> 00:00:46,638
(Leonard:)Wait, where are you going?

15
00:00:47,389 --> 00:00:48,429
(Leslie:)I'm sorry.

16
00:00:48,599 --> 00:00:51,979
I could've accepted our kids
being genetically unable to eat ice cream...

17
00:00:52,144 --> 00:00:54,434
(Leslie:)...or ever get a good view of a parade.

18
00:00:55,939 --> 00:01:10,029
(Leslie:)But this? This is a deal breaker.

